[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11162.71, "timestamp": "03:06:02", "text": "它说：“我的口袋感觉很沉。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11165.23, "timestamp": "03:06:05", "text": "哦，是的。可能需要制作"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11169.11, "timestamp": "03:06:09", "text": "一秒钟之内就把篮筐弄进了。制作"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11171.79, "timestamp": "03:06:11", "text": "碎石机。石头是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11179.269, "timestamp": "03:06:19", "text": "哦，是的。我们还必须做这些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11187.91, "timestamp": "03:06:27", "text": "哦，对了，让我再多拿一些……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11204.469, "timestamp": "03:06:44", "text": "哦，敌人就在我们面前。我懂了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11207.349, "timestamp": "03:06:47", "text": "去拿汤。顺便说一下，我放的果酱"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11209.55, "timestamp": "03:06:49", "text": "这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11212.71, "timestamp": "03:06:52", "text": "能。我要杀了这些豆子来获取一些法力。"}]